{"type":"message","id":"dd19494c","parentId":"419841b6","timestamp":"2026-07-17T16:15:17.872Z","message":{"role":"user","content":"==================================================================\nVAULT INITIALIZATION DIRECTIVE: ACTIVE REVENUE PROJECTS\n==================================================================\n\nJnr, our local Obsidian vault is live and running cleanly on Base 1. You are directed to establish our foundational project briefs natively into our new file-system layout.\n\nWrite the following 4 markdown files with clean formatting to their respective directories:\n\n1. Path: \"C:\\Users\\MikeT\\Projects\\WASP_Core_Update_Project\\vault\\1_Projects\\Chief_Madothi_Fund\\Brief.md\"\n   - Focus: Outreach setup, donation hooks, and tracking milestones.\n\n2. Path: \"C:\\Users\\MikeT\\Projects\\WASP_Core_Update_Project\\vault\\1_Projects\\Defend_Your_Faith_eBooks\\Brief.md\"\n   - Focus: Target niche arguments, structuring the first eBook, and outline goals.\n\n3. Path: \"C:\\Users\\MikeT\\Projects\\WASP_Core_Update_Project\\vault\\1_Projects\\Mythology_Subscriptions\\Brief.md\"\n   - Focus: Content generation pipelines, parental subscription setup, and fable outlines.\n\n4. Path: \"C:\\Users\\MikeT\\Projects\\WASP_Core_Update_Project\\vault\\1_Projects\\STEDT_Tyrone_Commissions\\Brief.md\"\n   - Focus: Scraper lead routing to feed Tyrone for high-probability quick wins.\n\nEnsure all entries use clean headers. Provide a flat confirmation here once the 4 files are written to disk.","timestamp":1784304913421,"idempotencyKey":"9f119ed0-df0a-4834-b08a-6859118a1f06:user"}}
{"type":"message","id":"e321cb23","parentId":"dd19494c","timestamp":"2026-07-17T16:15:32.268Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-40596f0f-529f-4622-9882-80224aca6b28","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\MikeT\\Projects\\WASP_Core_Update_Project\\vault\\1_Projects\\Chief_Madothi_Fund\\Brief.md","content":"# Chief Madothi Fund Brief\n\n## Outreach Setup\n- Identify target communities and partners.\n- Develop communication channels (email, social media, local events).\n\n## Donation Hooks\n- Implement recurring donation options.\n- Create matching gift campaigns.\n- Set up transparent donation tracking.\n\n## Tracking Milestones\n- Monthly donation totals.\n- Number of beneficiaries reached.\n- Fund allocation reports."},"partialArgs":"{\"path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\MikeT\\\\Projects\\\\WASP_Core_Update_Project\\\\vault\\\\1_Projects\\\\Chief_Madothi_Fund\\\\Brief.md\",\"content\":\"# Chief Madothi Fund Brief\\n\\n## Outreach Setup\\n- Identify target communities and partners.\\n- Develop communication channels (email, social media, local events).\\n\\n## Donation Hooks\\n- Implement recurring donation options.\\n- Create matching gift campaigns.\\n- Set up transparent donation tracking.\\n\\n## Tracking Milestones\\n- Monthly donation totals.\\n- Number of beneficiaries reached.\\n- Fund allocation reports.\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784304925077,"responseId":"chatcmpl-022c3e5a-64bf-408b-ba9e-c3c70c955b11"}}
