{"type":"message","id":"34633a8a","parentId":"703a87df","timestamp":"2026-07-17T21:40:28.448Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Target: Apply Master Palette Configuration and Structural Layout Update\r\nFiles: src/app/page.tsx (or main layout component), tailwind.config.js\r\nObjective: Re-skin the Mission Control app with the absolute multi-metal High Finance visual standard.\r\n\r\n[EXECUTION PROTOCOL: FULL CODE ONLY. DO NOT SHORTCUT WITH PLACEHOLDERS or SNIPPETS.]\r\n\r\n1. Execute the configuration setup block:\r\nEnsure 'tailwind.config.js' contains the exact color dictionary extensions:\r\n- 'rhythm-obsidian-deep': '#0A0C10'\r\n- 'rhythm-charcoal-matte': '#12161F'\r\n- 'rhythm-glass-specular': '#1E2530'\r\n- 'rhythm-goldenrod-core': '#DAA520'\r\n- 'rhythm-gold-liquid': '#C5A059'\r\n- 'rhythm-silver-mist': '#94A3B8'\r\n- 'rhythm-sage-metallic': '#7A8A80'\r\n- 'rhythm-slate-reflection': '#334155'\r\n- 'rhythm-maroon-depth': '#2D1A1E'\r\n\r\n2. Apply the Structural Skin in the Main Layout File:\r\n- Update the main grid container to force a solid, non-scrolling, two-column layouts matching Mike's strict operational dashboard layout rule.\r\n- Base Canvas background: bg-rhythm-obsidian-deep.\r\n- Main Headers: Use monospace fonts tracking out letter-spacing slightly, colored in `#E2E8F0` or `#C5A059`.\r\n- Cards & Modules: Apply: \"bg-rhythm-charcoal-matte border border-rhythm-slate-reflection/30 backdrop-blur-md shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] rounded-sm p-4\".\r\n- Dividers & Accent Rails: Apply crisp gradient wires using: \"h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-rhythm-gold-liquid/40 to-transparent\".\r\n\r\n3. Verification Step:\r\nRewrite the components completely to incorporate this palette. Do not touch background data streaming architectures; focus purely on the visual layer. Run the compiler check and confirm 0 build warnings."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"nvidia/nemotron-3