{"type":"message","id":"97a7184c","parentId":"34633a8a","timestamp":"2026-07-17T21:40:28.448Z","message":{"role":"user","content":"==================================================================\nFRONT-END INITIALIZATION DIRECTIVE: CONFIGURATION & TOKEN SYSTEM\n==================================================================\n\nJnr, execute the deployment of our official multi-metal High Finance token dictionary into the local workspace layout.\n\n1. TARGET FILE MODIFICATION:\n   - Path: \"tailwind.config.js\"\n   - Action: Completely overwrite the file with the finalized configuration block to inject the 'rhythm' color spectrum and monospaced font family arrays.\n\n2. TAILWIND CONFIGURATION CODE BLOCK:\n/** @type {import('tailwindcss').Config} */\nmodule.exports = {\n  content: [\n    \"./src/pages/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx,mdx}\",\n    \"./src/components/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx,mdx}\",\n    \"./src/app/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx,mdx}\",\n  ],\n  theme: {\n    extend: {\n      colors: {\n        rhythm: {\n          'obsidian-deep': '#0A0C10',\n          'charcoal-matte': '#12161F',\n          'glass-specular': '#1E2530',\n          'goldenrod-core': '#DAA520',\n          'gold-liquid': '#C5A059',\n          'silver-mist': '#94A3B8',\n          'sage-metallic': '#7A8A80',\n          'slate-reflection': '#334155',\n          'maroon-depth': '#2D1A1E',\n        },\n      },\n      fontFamily: {\n        mono: ['JetBrains Mono', 'Roboto Mono', 'ui-monospace', 'SFMono-Regular', 'Menlo', 'Monaco', 'Consolas', 'monospace'],\n      },\n    },\n  },\n  plugins: [],\n};\n\n3. VERIFICATION CYCLE:\n   - Run a clean state local compilation check to verify the new color mappings parse without syntax errors.\n   - Output a flat confirmation here once the file is fully written to disk and verified clean.","timestamp":1784317523086,"idempotencyKey":"ec4eacb7-11e7-4962-90de-c25b4e94a02e:user"}}
