ced</h4>\n                    <p className=\"text-xs text-rhythm-silver-mist mt-1 leading-relaxed\">\n                      Viewport arrays and active execution pipes are partitioned down into the <span className=\"text-[#C5A059] font-bold\">{contextLabels[context]}</span> target folder environment rules. Cross-directory leakage blocks active.\n                    </p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              {/* Core Architectural Telemetry Module Row */}\n              <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n                \n                {/* Telemetry Process Component Card */}\n                <div className=\"bg-rhythm-charcoal-matte border border-rhythm-slate-reflection/30 backdrop-blur-md shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] rounded-sm p-4\">\n                  <div className=\"border-b border-rhythm-slate-reflection/20 pb-2 mb-3 flex items-center justify-between\">\n                    <h3 className=\"text-xs font-bold text-[#C5A059] uppercase tracking-wider\">Operational Core</h3>\n                    <span className=\"text-[10px] text-[#10B981] bg-[#10B981]/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-sm font-bold\">ACTIVE</span>\n                  </div>\n                  <div className=\"space-y-2\">\n                    <div className=\"flex justify-between text-xs border-b border-rhythm-slate-reflection/10 py-1\">\n                      <span className=\"text-rhythm-silver-mist\">Directory Scope:</span>\n                      <span className=\"text-[#F8FAFC] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide\">{context.toLowerCase()}_layer</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div className=\"justify-between text-xs border-b border-rhythm-slate-reflection/10 py-1\">\n                      <span className=\"text-rhythm-silver-mist\">Heartbeat Loop Cadence:</span>\n                      <span className=\"text-rhythm-goldenrod-core font-bold\">120s Cron Interval</span>\n                    </di