206:             </div>\n207:           )}\n208: \n209:         </main>\n210:       </div>\n211:     </div>\n212:   );\n213: }\n214: \n\n Now, note that at line 22 we have:   };\n\n This is the closing brace of the contextLabels object and the semicolon.\n\n However, the error says: Unexpected token `div`. Expected jsx identifier.\n\n This is very strange because the token at line 22 is a closing brace and a semicolon.\n\n But note: the error message says that it expected a jsx identifier and found a div? \n Actually, the caret points at the '<' of the div on line 25.\n\n The error might be that the parser is expecting something else before the return statement.\n\n Let me check: after the object, we have a semicolon and then we have the return statement.\n\n However, note that in JavaScript, we can have a statement without a semicolon? \n But we have a semicolon.\n\n Another possibility: the object is not properly closed? \n But we have:\n\n   const contextLabels: Record<ProjectContext, string> = {\n     ... \n   };\n\n This is valid.\n\n Wait, note that in the object we are using a type annotation: `Record<ProjectContext, string>`.\n\n In a .tsx file, the angle brackets in the type annotation might be causing trouble? \n But we have been using them in the type aliases above and they were okay.\n\n However, note that the type alias for ProjectContext is on line 7 and we are using it in the type annotation on line 16.\n\n But the error is at line 22.\n\n Let me try to remove the type annotation on the contextLabels and see if it works.\n\n Alternatively, let me try to write the object without the type annotation and see.\n\n We'll change line 16 to:\n\n   const contextLabels = {\n     OVERALL_GROUP: 'Overall Group Operations',\n     CHIEF_MADOTHI: \"Chief Madothi Children's School & Feeding Fund\",\n     DEFEND_YOUR_FAITH: 'Defend Your Faith Digital eBooks',\n     MYTHOLOGY_SUBS: 'Mythology Subscription Engines',\n     STEDT_TYRONE: 'STEDT Tyrone Commission Pipelines'\n   };\n\n And then we remove the type annotation.\n\n But note: we are using the type in the return statement when we do `contextLabels[context]` and we want to make sure that the context is a key of the object.\n\n However, since we are setting the context state with a string that is one of the keys, and we are initializing with 'OVERALL_GROUP', it should be safe.\n\n Let's try that.\n\n We'll also remove the type annotation from the useState? We already changed to string literals.\n\n So, let's write the file again without the type annotation on the contextLabels.\n\n We'll do:\n\n   const contextLabels = {\n     OVERALL_GROUP: 'Overall Group Operations',\n     CHIEF_MADOTHI: \"Chief Madothi Children's School & Feeding Fund\",\n     DEFEND_YOUR_FAITH: 'Defend Your Faith Digital eBooks',\n     MYTHOLOGY_SUBS: 'Mythology Subscription Engines',\n     STEDT_TYRONE: 'STEDT Tyrone Commission Pipelines'\n   };\n\n And then we remove the colon and the type.\n\n Let's do that.\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-671a32f0-87c1-47ea-934f-7bc198225ac3","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"'use client';\n\nimport React, { useState } from 'react';\nimport KanbanBoard from '@/components/KanbanBoard';\n\n// Explicit type layout declarations for WASP context mapping\ntype ProjectContext = 'OVERALL_GROUP' | 'CHIEF_MADOTHI' | 'DEFEND_YOUR_FAITH' | 'MYTHOLOGY_SUBS' | 'STEDT_TYRONE';\ntype ActiveScreen = 'KANBAN' | 'CALENDAR' | 'PROJECTS' | 'BOARDROOM' | 'CAMPAIGNS' | 'OBSIDIAN' | 'PAPERCLIP' | 'SECURITY';\n\nexport default function MissionControlLayout() {\n  // Master navigation states - using string literals to avoid TSX parser issues with angle brackets\n  const [context, setContext] = useState('OVERALL_GROUP');\n  const [activeScreen, setActiveScreen] = useState('KANBAN');\n\n  // Multi-project context map dictionary\n  const contextLabels = {\n    OVERALL_GROUP: 'Overall Group Operations',\n    CHIEF_MADOTHI: \"Chief Madothi Children's School & Feeding Fund\",\n    DEFEND_YOUR_FAITH: 'Defend Your Faith Digital eBooks',\n    MYTHOLOGY_SUBS: 'Mythology Subscription Engines',\n    STEDT_TYRONE: 'STEDT Tyrone Commission Pipelines'\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"w-screen h-screen overflow-hidden bg-rhythm-obsidian-deep text-rhythm-silver-mist font-mono flex flex-col select-none antialiased\">\n      \n      {/* ==================== MASTER TOP PANEL BLOCK ==================== */}\n      <header className=\"h-16 w-full bg-rhythm-charcoal-matte border-b border-rhythm-slate-reflection/20 px-6 flex items-center justify-between z-50\">\n        <div className=\"flex items-center space-x-3\">\n          <div className=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rhythm-goldenrod-core animate-pulse\" />\n          <h1 className=\"text-[#E2E8F0] uppercase tracking-[0.05em] font-bold text-sm\">\n            WASP // Rhythm Nerve Center\n          </h1>\n        </div>\n        \n        {/* Context Selector Alignment Framework */}\n        <div className=\"flex items-center space-x-4\">\n          <span className=\"text-[11px] text-rhythm-sage-metallic uppercase tracking-wider\">Context Selector:</span>\n          <div className=\"relative\">\n            <select \n              value={context}\n              onChange={(e) => setContext(e.target.value as ProjectContext)}\n              className=\"bg-rhythm-glass-specular border border-rhythm-slate-reflection/40 text-[#C5A059] font-mono text-xs rounded-sm px-4 py-2 outline-none cursor-pointer hover:border-rhythm-gold-liquid/40 transition-colors duration-200 uppercase tracking-wide appearance-none pr-8 font-bold\"\n            >\n              <option value=\"OVERALL_GROUP\">🌐 Overall Group</option>\n              <option value=\"CHIEF_MADOTHI\">🦁 Chief Madothi</option>\n              <option value=\"DEFEND_YOUR_FAITH\">🛡️ Defend Faith</option>\n              <option value=\"MYTHOLOGY_SUBS\">🏛️ Mythology Subs</option>\n              <option value=\"STEDT_TYRONE\">📈 STEDT Tyrone</option>\n            </select>\n            <div className=\"absolute right-3 top-3.5 pointer-events-none text-rhythm-gold-liquid text-[9px]\">▼</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </header>\n\n      {/* Laser-Etched Horizontal Accent Rail */}\n      <div className=\"h-[1px] w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-rhythm-gold-liquid/40 to-transparent\" />\n\n      {/* ==================== FIXED TWO-COLUMN VIEWPORT MATRIX ==================== */}\n      <div className=\"flex-1 flex w-full overflow-hidden\">\n        \n        {/* NAVIGATION SIDEBAR PANEL */}\n        <aside className=\"w-64 bg-rhythm-charcoal-matte border-r border-rhythm-slate-reflection/20 flex flex-col justify-between p-4 z-40\">\n          <div className=\"space-y-1\">\n            <div className=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-rhythm-sage-metallic px-3 mb-3 font-bold\">\n              Mission Control Views\n            </div>\n            \n            {[\n              { id: 'KANBAN', label: '🗂️ Kanban Board' },\n              { id: 'CALENDAR', label: '📅 Calendar / Cron' },\n              { id: 'PROJECTS', label: '📂 Projects Hub' },\n              { id: 'BOARDROOM', label: '👥 The Boardroom' },\n              { id: 'CAMPAIGNS', label: '📡 Campaign Suites' },\n              { id: 'OBSIDIAN', label: '🧠 Obsidian Graph' },\n              { id: 'PAPERCLIP', label: '📎 Paperclip Ledger' },\n              { id: 'SECURITY', label: '🛡️ Security Inspector' },\n            ].map((tab) => (\n              <button\n                key={tab.id}\n                onClick={() => setActiveScreen(tab.id as ActiveScreen)}\n                className={`w-full text-left font-mono text-xs px-3 py-2.5 rounded-sm tracking-wide uppercase transition-all duration-150 flex items-center justify-between ${\n                  activeScreen === tab.id \n                    ? 'bg-rhythm-glass-specular border-l-2 border-rhythm-goldenrod-core text-[#F8FAFC]' \n                    : 'text-rhythm-silver-mist hover:bg-rhythm-glass-specular/40 hover:text-[#E2E8F0]'\n                }`}\n              >\n                <span>{tab.label}</span>\n                {activeScreen === tab.id && <span className=\"text-[10px] text-rhythm-gold-liquid\">◀</span>}\n              </button>\n            ))}\n          </div>\n\n          {/* Telemetry Base Plate */}\n          <div className=\"bg-rhythm-obsidian-deep border border-rhythm-slate-reflection/20 p-3 rounded-sm\">\n            <div className=\"text-[9px] text-rhythm-sage-metallic uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\">Grid Security</div>\n            <div className=\"justify-between text-[10px]\">\n              <span className=\"text-rhythm-silver-mist\">Node ID:</span>\n              <span className=\"text-[#C5A059] font-bold\">BASE_1</span>\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"justify-between text-[10px] mt-0.5\">\n              <span className=\"text-rhythm-silver-mist\">Status:</span>\n              <span className=\"text-[#10B981] font-bold\">VERIFIED</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </aside>\n\n        {/* ACTIVE CANVAS MAIN INTERACTIVE VIEWPORT */}\n        <main className=\"flex-1 h-full overflow-y-auto bg-rhythm-obsidian-deep p-6 relative\">\n          \n          {/* Header Layout Telemetry Track */}\n          <div className=\"mb-4 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-rhythm-slate-reflection/10 pb-3\">\n            <div>\n              <div className=\"text-[10px] text-rhythm-sage-metallic uppercase tracking-widest font-bold\">Workspace Viewport</div>\n              <h2 className=\"text-[#E2E8F0] tracking-[0.05em] text-lg font-bold uppercase mt-0.5\">\n                {activeScreen} 🛰️ <span className=\"text-[#C5A059] ml-2\">// {contextLabels[context]}</span>\n              </h2>\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"text-right text-[11px] text-rhythm-silver-mist font-bold\">\n              System Cycle: <span className=\"text-rhythm-goldenrod-core\">2026.07</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          {/* Conditional layout switching matrix */}\n          {activeScreen === 'KANBAN' ? (\n            <KanbanBoard context={context} />\n          ) : (\n            <div className=\"space-y-6\">\n              \n              {/* Dynamic Environment Routing Constraint Notice */}\n              <div className=\"bg-rhythm-charcoal-matte border border-rhythm-slate-reflection/30 backdrop-blur-md shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] rounded-sm p-4\">\n                <div className=\"flex items-start space-x-3\">\n                  <span className=\"text-rhythm-goldenrod-core text-base\">⚠️</span>\n                  <div>\n                    <h4 className=\"text-xs text-[#F8FAFC] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide\">Data Matrix Isolation Enforced</h4>\n                    <p className=\"text-xs text-rhythm-silver-mist mt-1 leading-relaxed\">\n                      Viewport arrays and active execution pipes are partitioned down into the <span className=\"text-[#C5A059] font-bold\">{contextLabels[context]}</span> target folder environment rules. Cross-directory leakage blocks active.\n                    </p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              {/* Core Architectural Telemetry Module Row */}\n              <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n                \n                {/* Telemetry Process Component Card */}\n                <div className=\"bg-rhythm-charcoal-matte border border-rhythm-slate-reflection/30 backdrop-blur-md shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] rounded-sm p-4\">\n                  <div className=\"border-b border-rhythm-slate-reflection/20 pb-2 mb-3 flex items-center justify-between\">\n                    <h3 className=\"text-xs font-bold text-[#C5A059] uppercase tracking-wider\">Operational Core</h3>\n                    <span className=\"text-[10px] text-[#10B981] bg-[#10B981]/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-sm font-bold\">ACTIVE</span>\n                  </div>\n                  <div className=\"space-y-2\">\n                    <div className=\"justify-between text-xs border-b border-rhythm-slate-reflection/10 py-1\">\n                      <span className=\"text-rhythm-silver-mist\">Directory Scope:</span>\n                      <span className=\"text-[#F8FAFC] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide\">{context.toLowerCase()}_layer</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div className=\"justify-between text-xs border-b border-rhythm-slate-reflection/10 py-1\">\n                      <span className=\"text-rhythm-silver-mist\">Heartbeat Loop Cadence:</span>\n                      <span className=\"text-rhythm-goldenrod-core font-bold\">120s Cron Interval</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div className=\"justify-between text-xs py-1\">\n                      <span className=\"text-rhythm-silver-mist\">Computed Token Ceiling:</span>\n                      <span className=\"text-rhythm-silver-mist\">150K Limit Matrix</span>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n\n                {/* Security Inspector State Card */}\n                <div className=\"bg-rhythm-charcoal-matte border border-rhythm-slate-reflection/30 backdrop-blur-md shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] rounded-sm p-4\">\n                  <div className=\"border-b border-rhythm-slate-reflection/20 pb-2 mb-3 flex items-center justify-between\">\n                    <h3 className=\"text-xs font-bold text-[#C5A059] uppercase tracking-wider\">System Governance</h3>\n                    <span className=\"text-[10px] text-rhythm-goldenrod-core bg-rhythm-goldenrod-core/5 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-sm font-bold\">MONITORING</span>\n                  </div>\n                  <div className=\"space-y-2"},"partialArgs":"{\"content\":\"'use client';\\n\\nimport React, { useState } from 'react';\\nimport KanbanBoard from '@/components/KanbanBoard';\\n\\n// Explicit type layout declarations for WASP context mapping\\ntype ProjectContext = 'OVERALL_GROUP' | 'CHIEF_MADOTHI' | 'DEFEND_YOUR_FAITH' | 'MYTHOLOGY_SUBS' | 'STEDT_TYRONE';\\ntype ActiveScreen = 'KANBAN' | 'CALENDAR' | 'PROJECTS' | 'BOARDROOM' | 'CAMPAIGNS' | 'OBSIDIAN' | 'PAPERCLIP' | 'SECURITY';\\n\\nexport default function MissionControlLayout() {\\n  // Master navigation states - using string literals to avoid TSX parser issues with angle brackets\\n  const [context, setContext] = useState('OVERALL_GROUP');\\n  const [activeScreen, setActiveScreen] = useState('KANBAN');\\n\\n  // Multi-project context map dictionary\\n  const contextLabels = {\\n    OVERALL_GROUP: 'Overall Group Operations',\\n    CHIEF_MADOTHI: \\\"Chief Madothi Children's School & Feeding Fund\\\",\\n    DEFEND_YOUR_FAITH: 'Defend Your Faith Digital eBooks',\\n    MYTHOLOGY_SUBS: 'Mythology Subscription Engines',\\n    STEDT_TYRONE: 'STEDT Tyrone Commission Pipelines'\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"w-screen h-screen overflow-hidden bg-rhythm-obsidian-deep text-rhythm-silver-mist font-mono flex flex-col select-none antialiased\\\">\\n      \\n      {/* ==================== MASTER TOP PANEL BLOCK ==================== */}\\n      <header className=\\\"h-16 w-full bg-rhythm-charcoal-matte border-b border-rhythm-slate-reflection/20 px-6 flex items-center justify-between z-50\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-3\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rhythm-goldenrod-core animate-pulse\\\" />\\n          <h1 className=\\\"text-[#E2E8F0] uppercase tracking-[0.05em] font-bold text-sm\\\">\\n            WASP // Rhythm Nerve Center\\n          </h1>\\n        </div>\\n        \\n        {/* Context Selector Alignment Framework */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-4\\\">\\n          <span className=\\\"text-[11px] text-rhythm-sage-metallic uppercase tracking-wider\\\">Context Selector:</span>\\n          <div className=\\\"relative\\\">\\n            <select \\n              value={context}\\n              onChange={(e) => setContext(e.target.value as ProjectContext)}\\n              className=\\\"bg-rhythm-glass-specular border border-rhythm-slate-reflection/40 text-[#C5A059] font-mono text-xs rounded-sm px-4 py-2 outline-none cursor-pointer hover:border-rhythm-gold-liquid/40 transition-colors duration-200 uppercase tracking-wide appearance-none pr-8 font-bold\\\"\\n            >\\n              <option value=\\\"OVERALL_GROUP\\\">🌐 Overall Group</option>\\n              <option value=\\\"CHIEF_MADOTHI\\\">🦁 Chief Madothi</option>\\n              <option value=\\\"DEFEND_YOUR_FAITH\\\">🛡️ Defend Faith</option>\\n              <option value=\\\"MYTHOLOGY_SUBS\\\">🏛️ Mythology Subs</option>\\n              <option value=\\\"STEDT_TYRONE\\\">📈 STEDT Tyrone</option>\\n            </select>\\n            <div className=\\\"absolute right-3 top-3.5 pointer-events-none text-rhythm-gold-liquid text-[9px]\\\">▼</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </header>\\n\\n      {/* Laser-Etched Horizontal Accent Rail */}\\n      <div className=\\\"h-[1px] w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-rhythm-gold-liquid/40 to-transparent\\\" />\\n\\n      {/* ==================== FIXED TWO-COLUMN VIEWPORT MATRIX ==================== */}\\n      <div className=\\\"flex-1 flex w-full overflow-hidden\\\">\\n        \\n        {/* NAVIGATION SIDEBAR PANEL */}\\n        <aside className=\\\"w-64 bg-rhythm-charcoal-matte border-r border-rhythm-slate-reflection/20 flex flex-col justify-between p-4 z-40\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"space-y-1\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-rhythm-sage-metallic px-3 mb-3 font-bold\\\">\\n              Mission Control Views\\n            </div>\\n            \\n            {[\\n              { id: 'KANBAN', label: '🗂️ Kanban Board' },\\n              { id: 'CALENDAR', label: '📅 Calendar / Cron' },\\n              { id: 'PROJECTS', label: '📂 Projects Hub' },\\n              { id: 'BOARDROOM', label: '👥 The Boardroom' },\\n              { id: 'CAMPAIGNS', label: '📡 Campaign Suites' },\\n              { id: 'OBSIDIAN', label: '🧠 Obsidian Graph' },\\n              { id: 'PAPERCLIP', label: '📎 Paperclip Ledger' },\\n              { id: 'SECURITY', label: '🛡️ Security Inspector' },\\n            ].map((tab) => (\\n              <button\\n                key={tab.id}\\n                onClick={() => setActiveScreen(tab.id as ActiveScreen)}\\n                className={`w-full text-left font-mono text-xs px-3 py-2.5 rounded-sm tracking-wide uppercase transition-all duration-150 flex items-center justify-between ${\\n                  activeScreen === tab.id \\n                    ? 'bg-rhythm-glass-specular border-l-2 border-rhythm-goldenrod-core text-[#F8FAFC]' \\n                    : 'text-rhythm-silver-mist hover:bg-rhythm-glass-specular/40 hover:text-[#E2E8F0]'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                <span>{tab.label}</span>\\n                {activeScreen === tab.id && <span className=\\\"text-[10px] text-rhythm-gold-liquid\\\">◀</span>}\\n              </button>\\n            ))}\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Telemetry Base Plate */}\\n          <div className=\\\"bg-rhythm-obsidian-deep border border-rhythm-slate-reflection/20 p-3 rounded-sm\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"text-[9px] text-rhythm-sage-metallic uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\\\">Grid Security</div>\\n            <div className=\\\"justify-between text-[10px]\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"text-rhythm-silver-mist\\\">Node ID:</span>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[#C5A059] font-bold\\\">BASE_1</span>\\n            </div>\\n            <div className=\\\"justify-between text-[10px] mt-0.5\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"text-rhythm-silver-mist\\\">Status:</span>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[#10B981] font-bold\\\">VERIFIED</span>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </aside>\\n\\n        {/* ACTIVE CANVAS MAIN INTERACTIVE VIEWPORT */}\\n        <main className=\\\"flex-1 h-full overflow-y-auto bg-rhythm-obsidian-deep p-6 relative\\\">\\n          \\n          {/* Header Layout Telemetry Track */}\\n          <div className=\\\"mb-4 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-rhythm-slate-reflection/10 pb-3\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <div className=\\\"text-[10px] text-rhythm-sage-metallic uppercase tracking-widest font-bold\\\">Workspace Viewport</div>\\n              <h2 className=\\\"text-[#E2E8F0] tracking-[0.05em] text-lg font-bold uppercase mt-0.5\\\">\\n                {activeScreen} 🛰️ <span className=\\\"text-[#C5A059] ml-2\\\">// {contextLabels[context]}</span>\\n              </h2>\\n            </div>\\n            <div className=\\\"text-right text-[11px] text-rhythm-silver-mist font-bold\\\">\\n              System Cycle: <span className=\\\"text-rhythm-goldenrod-core\\\">2026.07</span>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Conditional layout switching matrix */}\\n          {activeScreen === 'KANBAN' ? (\\n            <KanbanBoard context={context} />\\n          ) : (\\n            <div className=\\\"space-y-6\\\">\\n              \\n              {/* Dynamic Environment Routing Constraint Notice */}\\n              <div className=\\\"bg-rhythm-charcoal-matte border border-rhythm-slate-reflection/30 backdrop-blur-md shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] rounded-sm p-4\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-start space-x-3\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-rhythm-goldenrod-core text-base\\\">⚠️</span>\\n                  <div>\\n                    <h4 className=\\\"text-xs text-[#F8FAFC] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide\\\">Data Matrix Isolation Enforced</h4>\\n                    <p className=\\\"text-xs text-rhythm-silver-mist mt-1 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n                      Viewport arrays and active execution pipes are partitioned down into the <span className=\\\"text-[#C5A059] font-bold\\\">{contextLabels[context]}</span> target folder environment rules. Cross-directory leakage blocks active.\\n                    </p>\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Core Architectural Telemetry Module Row */}\\n              <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\\\">\\n                \\n                {/* Telemetry Process Component Card */}\\n                <div className=\\\"bg-rhythm-charcoal-matte border border-rhythm-slate-reflection/30 backdrop-blur-md shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] rounded-sm p-4\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"border-b border-rhythm-slate-reflection/20 pb-2 mb-3 flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n                    <h3 className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-[#C5A059] uppercase tracking-wider\\\">Operational Core</h3>\\n                    <span className=\\\"text-[10px] text-[#10B981] bg-[#10B981]/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-sm font-bold\\\">ACTIVE</span>\\n                  </div>\\n                  <div className=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n                    <div className=\\\"justify-between text-xs border-b border-rhythm-slate-reflection/10 py-1\\\">\\n                      <span className=\\\"text-rhythm-silver-mist\\\">Directory Scope:</span>\\n                      <span className=\\\"text-[#F8FAFC] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide\\\">{context.toLowerCase()}_layer</span>\\n                    </div>\\n                    <div className=\\\"justify-between text-xs border-b border-rhythm-slate-reflection/10 py-1\\\">\\n                      <span className=\\\"text-rhythm-silver-mist\\\">Heartbeat Loop Cadence:</span>\\n                      <span className=\\\"text-rhythm-goldenrod-core font-bold\\\">120s Cron Interval</span>\\n                    </div>\\n                    <div className=\\\"justify-between text-xs py-1